DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3309::$$$message_0023_0000_0000$$$::I go to the living room to start setting up for lunch, when to my surprise I find Saber in there, reading.::
3310::$$$message_0023_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3311::$$$message_0023_0001_0001$$$::She doesn't seem to have noticed me, and is hunched over a desk with eyes wide, like a cat.[lr]::
3312::$$$message_0023_0001_0002$$$::I'm curious about the magazine, but I don't want to interrupt her, so I head straight towards the kitchen...::
3313::$$$message_0023_0002_0000$$$::"Shirou, you came at just the right time."[lr]::
3314::$$$message_0023_0002_0001$$$::"Hm? What do you need?"[lr]::
3315::$$$message_0023_0002_0002$$$::I turn when she calls me. Saber's looking up from her book.[lr]::
3316::$$$message_0023_0002_0003$$$::She holds out a large magazine with a faded cover. It's an unexpected sight. I thought Saber would be reading something more serious-looking.::
3317::$$$message_0023_0003_0000$$$::"Shirou, what does this 'foie gras' thing taste like?"[lr]::
3318::$$$message_0023_0003_0001$$$::"...Foie gras?"::
3319::$$$message_0023_0004_0000$$$::"Yes. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服13b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服13b(中) textoff=0]Also, caviar, [wvl canskip=false time=400]truffles, [wvl canskip=false time=400]shark fin, [wvl canskip=false time=400]swallow's nest, [wvl canskip=false time=300]matsutake, splendid alfonsino, spiny lobster, Jinhua ham, Peking duck, helmeted Guineafowl, pufferfish, softshell turtle, wasanbon, Yubari melon, Matsusaka beef..."[lr]::
3320::$$$message_0023_0004_0001$$$::"W-wait, Saber. What are you talking about?"[lr]::
3321::$$$message_0023_0004_0002$$$::Saber looks so serious that I'm intimidated and lose track of the conversation.::
3322::$$$message_0023_0005_0000$$$::"Why are you suddenly interested in these things?"[lr]::
3323::$$$message_0023_0005_0001$$$::"Because of this."[lr]::
3324::$$$message_0023_0005_0002$$$::I look at the cover of the magazine she's holding.[lr]::
3325::$$$message_0023_0005_0003$$$::[font italic=true]High-Class Ingredients to Try at Least Once[font italic=false]...?::
3326::$$$message_0023_0006_0000$$$::"What's this magazine?"[lr]::
3327::$$$message_0023_0006_0001$$$::I don't remember buying it. Even if I did buy it, I'd have no way to use it.[lr]::
3328::$$$message_0023_0006_0002$$$::Sakura has a bunch of cookbooks I wouldn't buy in her room, but this is more of a travel guide.::
3329::$$$message_0023_0007_0000$$$::"Taiga left it here earlier."[lr]::
3330::$$$message_0023_0007_0001$$$::Ah, I see the hidden agenda now.::
3331::$$$message_0023_0008_0000$$$::She probably thought that if she dropped the magazine in the living room, Sakura or I would be inspired to make matsutake mushrooms for dinner, or something.[lr]::
3332::$$$message_0023_0008_0001$$$::...And her plan's already halfway succeeded just by captivating Saber.[lr]::
3333::$$$message_0023_0008_0002$$$::"...And you're curious about it?"::
3334::$$$message_0023_0009_0000$$$::"Yes. It's full of ingredients that everyone ought to try at least once. They must all be delicious."[lr]::
3335::$$$message_0023_0009_0001$$$::Saber's fascinated by the expensive ingredients she's never seen before.[lr]::
3336::$$$message_0023_0009_0002$$$::They might be expensive for a normal person, but people of high status probably see these things on the dinner table often enough.::
3337::$$$message_0023_0010_0000$$$::"Saber, you were a king who lived in a castle, right? You would've eaten expensive[line len=2]"[lr]::
3338::$$$message_0023_0010_0001$$$::Oh no. Don't say that. I just screwed up.[lr]::
3339::$$$message_0023_0010_0002$$$::Saber did live in a royal palace, but luxurious court cuisine and formal table manners didn't exist in her era.[lr]::
3340::$$$message_0023_0010_0003$$$::Not to mention, it was the French who made that kind of fine dining famous...however many centuries later.::
3341::$$$message_0023_0011_0000$$$::"...Shirou, I believe I said it before. [l][say storage=emi0235_sav_0071 name=セイバー]The meals in my time [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服20b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服20b(中) textoff=0]consisted of meat cooked on a spit and thrown onto the table, without even plates to eat on. We'd then use a knife to carve[line len=2]"::
3342::$$$message_0023_0012_0000$$$::"Sorry, Saber. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服20a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服20a(中) textoff=0]That was my fault...[l][say storage=emi0235_shi_0071 name=士郎]I was going to make it up to you by asking if there's anything in there you want to eat, but..."[lr]::
3343::$$$message_0023_0012_0001$$$::There's no way my pantry can accommodate a casual request to try anything from that magazine.::
3344::$$$message_0023_0013_0000$$$::"...If it's a single portion just for you, I might be able to make it work."[lr]::
3345::$$$message_0023_0013_0001$$$::"A single [wvl canskip=false time=600]portion?"::
3346::$$$message_0023_0014_0000$$$::"Yeah, but that's the best I can do.[lr]::
3347::$$$message_0023_0014_0001$$$::Also, if Tohsaka could stay off the jewels and chip in here instead, we might be able to take everyone to a fancy restaurant in Shinto, but..."::
3348::$$$message_0023_0015_0000$$$::"...With Rin I doubt that will ever happen."[lr]::
3349::$$$message_0023_0015_0001$$$::I completely agree.[lr]::
3350::$$$message_0023_0015_0002$$$::It's not that I want to call her a cheapskate, a scrooge, or a miser from birth...but I just can't imagine Tohsaka ever being that generous with her money.::
3351::$$$message_0023_0016_0000$$$::"Right? So I'd love to take you all to a bougie place like that, but until that happens, I need you to be patient with what I can make at home."::
3352::$$$message_0023_0017_0000$$$::"What are you talking about, Shirou? [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服05c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服05c(中) textoff=0]I am very satisfied with my meals in this house. I've never once felt I needed to be patient or tolerant of your food."::
3353::$$$message_0023_0018_0000$$$::She says it with an earnest, pleasant smile.[lr]::
3354::$$$message_0023_0018_0001$$$::It motivates me to make today's lunch extra special.::
3355::$$$message_0023_0019_0000$$$::"That's why... I trust that one day, you will acquire those ingredients and serve us a luxurious meal at this dinner table."[lr]::
3356::$$$message_0023_0019_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
3357::$$$message_0023_0019_0002$$$::"I believe."::
3358::$$$message_0023_0020_0000$$$::B-believe in what?[lr]::
3359::$$$message_0023_0020_0001$$$::Saber places wild expectations on me.[lr]::
3360::$$$message_0023_0020_0002$$$::Then, she flips through the magazine and stops on the page she's looking for.::
3361::$$$message_0023_0021_0000$$$::"Foie is goose. So why don't we begin by raising a goose?"[lr]::
3362::$$$message_0023_0021_0001$$$::"And gras is...No, hold on one second[line len=2]"::
3363::$$$message_0023_0022_0000$$$::"If a goose is too much trouble, then we could raise a pig. Pigs are the ideal livestock.[lr]::
3364::$$$message_0023_0022_0001$$$::Shirou, did you know that this magazine says that only sows can find Mediterranean truffles?[lr]::
3365::$$$message_0023_0022_0002$$$::Of course, we could also make ham from one. There's no need to be fixated on a particular delicacy."::
3366::$$$message_0023_0023_0000$$$::"Give me that magazine. I'm sending it back where it came from!"::
3367::$$$message_0023_0024_0000$$$::Saber quickly stands up and evades my outstretched hand.[lr]::
3368::$$$message_0023_0024_0001$$$::Then she briskly makes her way into the hallway, dons sandals, and goes out into the yard.[lr]::
3369::$$$message_0023_0024_0002$$$::"Hey!"::
3370::$$$message_0023_0025_0000$$$::"Saber, it's dangerous to walk around while reading..."::
3371::$$$message_0023_0026_0000$$$::"I've finally noticed something, Shirou.[lr]::
3372::$$$message_0023_0026_0001$$$::This mansion is missing something the castle in my homeland had...[se storage=se089.wav][movefg opacity=0 left=200 time=80 accel=-1 storage=セイバー私服01a(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=120][fg opacity=0 left=0 top=74 time=10 storage=セイバー私服09a(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=200 top=74 time=300 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服09a(近) textoff=0][se storage=se092.wav][wvl canskip=true time=300]a vegetable garden and an animal pen! Fortunately, our yard is very spacious..."[wait canskip=0 time=500][cltransparent]::
3373::$$$message_0023_0027_0000$$$::"Wait, don't tell me Kiritsugu chose this plot of land with that in mind!"::
3374::$$$message_0023_0028_0000$$$::"Nope. I guarantee you that my old man wasn't that weirdly resourceful.[lr]::
3375::$$$message_0023_0028_0001$$$::I'll admit that it could be nice to grow a vegetable garden, though.[lr]::
3376::$$$message_0023_0028_0002$$$::But we aren't raising any pigs or geese or soft-shelled turtles. Our hands are already full with one she-tiger!"::
3377::$$$message_0023_0029_0000$$$::"A tiger...[lr]::
3378::$$$message_0023_0029_0001$$$::In ancient times, tiger meat was prized as 'bamboo' to the 'cherry blossom' of horse meat. I wonder how it would taste... Hmm... With butter...?"::
3379::$$$message_0023_0030_0000$$$::Saber spaces out in the middle of the yard. There's a filter on her ears that only lets through what she wants to hear.[lr]::
3380::$$$message_0023_0030_0001$$$::"Heyyy! Come home, Your Majesty! Your Grace!"::
3381::$$$message_0023_0031_0000$$$::"There's still hope, even if it can't be done in this yard. We're fortunate that Fuyuki is abundant in natural wealth.[lr]::
3382::$$$message_0023_0031_0001$$$::It is a fertile land blessed by God with the bounties of the mountains, the forest, and the sea. Ahh...a dream come true."::
3383::$$$message_0023_0032_0000$$$::"Okay, but wipe your drool first, Saber."[lr]::
3384::$$$message_0023_0032_0001$$$::Saber gazes out into the autumn sky, clutching that devilish rag to her chest and dreaming of an ever-distant kingdom of food.::��